invariant: INV-5
file: x509_pem.c
catches: pem_files_rsa_test
reason: x509_pem_integer_to_bytes reads out_len + 1 octets whose first is
  not zero as the last out_len of them, so a value one octet over its
  field decodes cut short. test_written writes a dp of 129 octets.

--- old
        bad |= first_zero ^ 1;
--- new
        (void)first_zero;
